@LanguageCenter.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5204

### 1. Backend còn sống?
GET {{LanguageCenter.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Kết nối database OK? (có đếm record VaiTro)
GET {{LanguageCenter.Api_HostAddress}}/health/database
Accept: application/json

### 3. DEVELOPMENT-ONLY: thông tin database + số lượng record
GET {{LanguageCenter.Api_HostAddress}}/api/development/database-info
Accept: application/json

### 4. Swagger UI (mở bằng browser)
# {{LanguageCenter.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger

### 5. OpenAPI document (JSON)
GET {{LanguageCenter.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json
